at $y=0$ and $y=-4.$\n\n- The equation ${y}^{′}=(y+1)^{2}(y+4)$ does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side evaluates to zero at $y=-1$ and $y=-4.$\n\n- The equation ${y}^{′}=-y(y+1)(y+4)$ does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side evaluates to zero at $y=0$ and $y=-4,$ but it also evaluates to zero when $y=-1,$ which is not behavior exhibited by our slope field.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312197 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312198 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312199 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312200 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312201 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1041 "selection" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312199 13194139534820 true] [17592186312196 1110 #uuid "85f09089-2328-5171-87e2-062d32b0c0e0" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312197 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312197 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534820 true] [17592186312197 1111 #uuid "753cdb5a-4ee8-5337-a4d2-d4d47de5ca33" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312198 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312198 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534820 true] [17592186312198 1111 #uuid "e1fa176e-e7b1-54ef-8d20-58f23d7c2046" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312199 1034 "I only" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312199 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534820 true] [17592186312199 1111 #uuid "8caa5386-a39e-541b-81af-d68ba86a614f" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312200 1034 "III only" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312200 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534820 true] [17592186312200 1111 #uuid "60e07d00-ce67-5a79-852c-f5183f21fe6c" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312201 1034 "II only" 13194139534820 true] [17592186312201 1103 #edb/ref 1759218604545